"text": "Drive on the right. Limits: 40 km/h towns, 60–80 rural, 100 max. Speed cameras, big fines. No driving after dark (dark about 17:30); arrive by 16:30–17:00. Never drive into water you can't see the bottom of. One-lane bridge: the side with the CEDA sign waits. Right on red only if clear and no sign. Seatbelts on.",
"type": "good",
"id": "good62",
"o": 62,
"u": 1791900000000
},
"good63": {
"name": "La Fortuna → Monteverde",
"text": "Last 35 km after Tilarán is gravel, potholes, steep. Slow, 4x4, daylight only.",
"type": "good",
"id": "good63",
"o": 63,
"u": 1791900000000
},
"good64": {
"name": "Weather",
"text": "End of rainy season. October is the wettest; drier in November. Sunny mornings, rainy afternoons. Caribbean side is dry Sep–Oct, wet in Nov (backup if the Pacific is bad).",
"type": "good",
"id": "good64",
"o": 64,
"u": 1791900000000
},
"good65": {
"name": "Money",
"text": "Colones (CRC). US dollars OK in tourist areas. Cards work almost everywhere.",
"type": "good",
"id": "good65",
"o": 65,
"u": 1791900000000
},
"good66": {
"name": "Day 1",
"text": "Land in the dark; night 1 is only 30 min away.",
"type": "good",
"id": "good66",
"o": 66,
"u": 1791900000000
